capability nats/errors  the server's errors that leave the connection open, a permission refused
  heroes  nats.take_errors
  go      Conn.LastError, ErrorHandler, Conn.SetErrorHandler, ErrPermissionViolation, PermissionErrOnSubscribe
  rust    ServerError, Event (ServerError)
